arithmetic: C1 11  E1 17  G1 -10  H1 1
THE TYPED REFUSAL, D1 = A1+B1 with text in B1: REFUSED: B1 holds text, and + wants a number
division by zero: REFUSED: division by zero
aggregates over a range holding a label and an unfilled cell:
  SUM 35  COUNT 3  MIN 5  MAX 20  AVERAGE 11
  MIN over a range with no numbers: REFUSED: MIN has no numbers to work on
conditionals: IF true 100  IF false 200  SUMIF 5 10  COUNTIF 5 2
  an unfilled cell is not the number zero: COUNTIF 0 is 0
text: LEN 15  TRIM [Hello World]  LEN of TRIM 11
  UPPER [  HELLO WORLD  ]  LOWER [  hello world  ]
  CONCAT [  Hello World  !]
a cycle refuses before any value is computed: REFUSED: a cycle through A1 B1
a total over a refusal is a refusal: REFUSED: division by zero
DERIVED ORDER: A1 = B1*2 typed first, B1 = C1+1, C1 is 4, so A1 is 10
